BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 169.00 Td (self-wrought by a rational concept, and, therefore, is specifically) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 154.00 Td (distinct from all feelings of the former kind, which may be referred) Tj ET
