BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 436.00 Td (may be much more injurious to me than any mischief which I seek to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 421.00 Td (avoid at present, it should be considered whether it would not be more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 406.00 Td (prudent to act herein according to a universal maxim and to make it a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 391.00 Td (habit to promise nothing except with the intention of keeping it. But it) Tj ET
