BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 361.00 Td (fear of consequences. Now it is a wholly different thing to be truthful) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 346.00 Td (from duty and to be so from apprehension of injurious consequences.) Tj ET
