BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 297.00 Td (answer was postponed in order that I might make it complete. But it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 282.00 Td (simply this: that the teachers themselves have not got their own) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 267.00 Td (notions clear, and when they endeavour to make up for this by raking) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 252.00 Td (up motives of moral goodness from every quarter, trying to make their) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 237.00 Td (physic right strong, they spoil it. For the commonest understanding) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 222.00 Td (shows that if we imagine, on the one hand, an act of honesty done) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 207.00 Td (with steadfast mind, apart from every view to advantage of any kind in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 192.00 Td (this world or another, and even under the greatest temptations of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 177.00 Td (necessity or allurement, and, on the other hand, a similar act which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 162.00 Td (was affected, in however low a degree, by a foreign motive, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 147.00 Td (former leaves far behind and eclipses the second; it elevates the soul) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 132.00 Td (and inspires the wish to be able to act in like manner oneself. Even) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 117.00 Td (moderately young children feel this impression, ana one should never) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 102.00 Td (represent duties to them in any other light.) Tj ET
