BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 511.00 Td (the highest degree speculative; that they cannot be obtained by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 496.00 Td (abstraction from any empirical, and therefore merely contingent,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 481.00 Td (knowledge; that it is just this purity of their origin that makes them) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 466.00 Td (worthy to serve as our supreme practical principle, and that just in) Tj ET
