BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 226.00 Td (which in such distinct branches of science is easily done\); knowing) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 211.00 Td (well that unless we are in possession of this, it would not only be vain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 196.00 Td (to determine the moral element of duty in right actions for purposes of) Tj ET
