BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 402.00 Td (have the faculty of acting according to the conception of laws, that is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 387.00 Td (according to principles, i.e., have a will. Since the deduction of actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 372.00 Td (from principles requires reason, the will is nothing but practical) Tj ET
