BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 222.00 Td (which objectively are recognised as necessary are subjectively) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 207.00 Td (contingent, and the determination of such a will according to objective) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 192.00 Td (laws is obligation, that is to say, the relation of the objective laws to a) Tj ET
