BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 417.00 Td (nor of the duties of benevolence to others \(for many a one would) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 402.00 Td (gladly consent that others should not benefit him, provided only that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 387.00 Td (he might be excused from showing benevolence to them\), nor finally) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 372.00 Td (that of duties of strict obligation to one another, for on this principle) Tj ET
