BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 293.00 Td (an end in itself, it must also harmonize with it. Now there are in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 278.00 Td (humanity capacities of greater perfection, which belong to the end that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 263.00 Td (nature has in view in regard to humanity in ourselves as the subject: to) Tj ET
