BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 233.00 Td (humanity as an end in itself, but not with the advancement of this end.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 214.00 Td (Fourthly, as regards meritorious duties towards others: The natural) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 199.00 Td (end which all men have is their own happiness. Now humanity might) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 184.00 Td (indeed subsist, although no one should contribute anything to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 169.00 Td (happiness of others, provided he did not intentionally withdraw) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 154.00 Td (anything from it; but after all this would only harmonize negatively) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 139.00 Td (not positively with humanity as an end in itself, if every one does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 124.00 Td (also endeavour, as far as in him lies, to forward the ends of others. For) Tj ET
