BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 541.00 Td (independently that there are practical propositions which command) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 526.00 Td (categorically, nor can it be proved in this section; one thing, however,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 511.00 Td (could be done, namely, to indicate in the imperative itself, by some) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 496.00 Td (determinate expression, that in the case of volition from duty all) Tj ET
