BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 466.00 Td (distinguished from hypothetical imperatives. This is done in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 451.00 Td (present \(third\) formula of the principle, namely, in the idea of the will) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 436.00 Td (of every rational being as a universally legislating will.) Tj ET
