BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 154.00 Td (humour, have fancy value; on the other hand, fidelity to promises,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 139.00 Td (benevolence from principle \(not from instinct\), have an intrinsic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 124.00 Td (worth. Neither nature nor art contains anything which in default of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 109.00 Td (these it could put in their place, for their worth consists not in the) Tj ET
