BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 503.00 Td (We have finally reduced the definite conception of morality to the idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 488.00 Td (of freedom. This latter, however, we could not prove to be actually a) Tj ET
