BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 289.00 Td (all other being endowed with reason? I will allow that no interest) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 274.00 Td (urges me to this, for that would not give a categorical imperative, but I) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 259.00 Td (must take an interest in it and discern how this comes to pass; for this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 244.00 Td (properly an "I ought" is properly an "I would," valid for every rational) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 229.00 Td (being, provided only that reason determined his actions without any) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 214.00 Td (hindrance. But for beings that are in addition affected as we are by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 199.00 Td (springs of a different kind, namely, sensibility, and in whose case that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 184.00 Td (is not always done which reason alone would do, for these that) Tj ET
