BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 541.00 Td (purely moral; or in other words, how pure reason can be practical- to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 526.00 Td (explain this is beyond the power of human reason, and all the labour) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 511.00 Td (and pains of seeking an explanation of it are lost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 492.00 Td (It is just the same as if I sought to find out how freedom itself is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 477.00 Td (possible as the causality of a will. For then I quit the ground of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 462.00 Td (philosophical explanation, and I have no other to go upon. I might) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 447.00 Td (indeed revel in the world of intelligences which still remains to me,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 432.00 Td (but although I have an idea of it which is well founded, yet I have not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 417.00 Td (the least knowledge of it, nor an I ever attain to such knowledge with) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 402.00 Td (all the efforts of my natural faculty of reason. It signifies only a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 387.00 Td (something that remains over when I have eliminated everything) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 372.00 Td (belonging to the world of sense from the actuating principles of my) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 357.00 Td (will, serving merely to keep in bounds the principle of motives taken) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 342.00 Td (from the field of sensibility; fixing its limits and showing that it does) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 327.00 Td (not contain all in all within itself, but that there is more beyond it; but) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 312.00 Td (this something more I know no further. Of pure reason which frames) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 297.00 Td (this ideal, there remains after the abstraction of all matter, i.e.,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 282.00 Td (knowledge of objects, nothing but the form, namely, the practical law) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 267.00 Td (of the universality of the maxims, and in conformity with this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 252.00 Td (conception of reason in reference to a pure world of understanding as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 237.00 Td (a possible efficient cause, that is a cause determining the will. There) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 222.00 Td (must here be a total absence of springs; unless this idea of an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 207.00 Td (intelligible world is itself the spring, or that in which reason primarily) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 192.00 Td (takes an interest; but to make this intelligible is precisely the problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 177.00 Td (that we cannot solve.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 158.00 Td (Here now is the extreme limit of all moral inquiry, and it is of great) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 143.00 Td (importance to determine it even on this account, in order that reason) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 128.00 Td (may not on the one hand, to the prejudice of morals, seek about in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 113.00 Td (world of sense for the supreme motive and an interest comprehensible) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 98.00 Td (but empirical; and on the other hand, that it may not impotently flap) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 83.00 Td (its wings without being able to move in the \(for it\) empty space of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 205.50 28 Td (85) Tj ET
