BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 511.00 Td (must be\). It cannot be blamed for refusing to explain this necessity by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 496.00 Td (a condition, that is to say, by means of some interest assumed as a) Tj ET
